  "note": "A device of the book's Temme-integral route for sgn ℓ = sgn τ. §8.4.2 defines the I_j the same way for ℓ < 0. Lean's one-ray bound is uniform in sgn δ (it uses −2πδ r sinθ ≤ 2π|δ||sinθ|r), so Thm 8.0.1's case split disappears."
